{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Before [A7]Je[D]ho[G]va[A]h's [D]aw[A]fu[E7]l[A]throne [D]Ye nations, [G]bow [D]with [Em]sa[D]cred [A]joy;
[D]Know that [A7]the [D]Lord is [G]Go[D]d [A7]a [D][A]lone; [D]He [G]can [A7]cre[D]ate, [G]and [D]He [A7]de[D]stroy.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D][A7][D]His [G][A]sovereign [D][A][E7]power, [A][D]without [G][D][Em]our [D][A]aid,
[D][A7]Made [D][G]us [D][A7]of [D][A]clay, [D][G]and [A7][D]formed [G][D]us [A7][D]men;
[D][A7][D]and [G][A]when [D][A]like [E7][A]wandering [D][G]sheep [D][Em]we [D][A]strayed,
[D][A7][D]He [G][D]brought [A7][D]us [A][D][G]to [A7][D]His [G][D]fold [A7][D]again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D][A7][D]We'll [G][A]crowd [D][A]His [E7][A]gates [D][G]with [D][Em]thankful [D][A]songs,
[D][A7][D]High [G][D]as [A7][D]the [A][D][G]heavens [A7][D]our [G][D]voices [A7][D]raise;
[D][A7][D]And [G][A]earth, [D][A]with [E7][A]her [D][G]ten [D][Em]thousand [D][A]tongues,
[D][A7][D]Shall [G][D]fill [A7][D]His [A][D][G]courts [A7][D]with [G][D]sounding [A7][D]praise.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D][A7][D]Wide [G][A]as [D][A]the [E7][A]world [D][G]is [D][Em]His [D][A]command,
[D][A7][D][G]Vast [D][A7][D]as [A][D][G]Eternity [A7][D][G]His [D][A7][D]love;
[D][A7]Firm [D][G]as [A][D]a [A][E7]rock [A][D]His [G][D]truth [Em][D]shall [A]stand,
[D][A7][D]When [G][D]rolling [A7][D]years [A][D][G]shall [A7][D]cease [G][D]to [A7][D]move.
{end_of_verse}
